{"articleNo":"865","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=865&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"산학협력단(인적자원개발센터) 계약직원 채용 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.29","hit":"19710","attachments":[{"name":"이력서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=865&attachNo=69327"},{"name":"자기소개서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=865&attachNo=69329"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">직원 채용공고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;금오공과대학교 인적자원개발센터(HRD센터) 행정업무를 담당할 계약직 직업훈련전담자 및 보조자를 아래와 같이 모집하니 많은 지원을 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">1. 채용예정분야 및 인원 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 전문계약직 직업훈련전담자 1명</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 일반계약직 직업훈련보조자 1명&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2. 응시자격</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국가공무원법 제33조(결격사유) 각 호의 1에 해당하지 않는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직업훈련경력(직업훈련과 관련된 행정업무 또는 훈련실시경력)이 3년 이상인자</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">(전담자만 해당)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학력 제한 없음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 컴퓨터 활용이 가능한 자(자격증 소지자 우대)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">3. 보수수준 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 직업훈련전담자 : 연봉 3,520만원 이내(4대보험포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직업훈련보조자 : 연봉 1,680만원 이내(4대보험포함)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 경력 등을 고려하여 고용계약 체결시 보수를 연봉 협상후 결정함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">4. 계약기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2010년 06월 30일까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">5. 근무예정일 : 8월 中</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">6. 근무조건 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 주 5일근무 (09:00～18:00)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">7. 근 무 지 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">금오공과대학교 인적자원개발센터 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 69.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -69.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">8. 제출서류 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 이력서(붙임 서식), 자기소개서(붙임 서식), 주민등록등본, 최종학력(예정)증명서, </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 69.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -69.4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;경력증명서, 자격증사본(해당자) 각 1부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">9. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2009. 8. 04(화)09:00 ～2009. 8. 7(금) 18:00</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">10. 제출방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">방문접수(본인)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">금오공과대학교 인적자원개발센터(경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 글로벌관 541호)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 우편접수는 하지 않으며, 제출서류에 반드시 연락처(전화번호)를 기재</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">11. 채용방법</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 1차시험 : 서류심사</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 2차시험 : 면접시험(1차시험 합격자에 한하여 시간, 장소 개별 통보)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 최종합격자 : 개별 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">12. 문 의 처 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 금오공과대학교 산학협력단(담당자 : 054-478-7254)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">13. 다운로드 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> 이력서 서식(한글 2005), 자기소개서 서식(한글 2005)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">2009. 07.&nbsp; 28.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">금오공과대학교산학협력단장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
